<title>CANADA: AT&amp;T to be at Rogers Cantel briefing.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T to be at Rogers Cantel briefing.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp's Canadian subsidiary will join Rogers Cantel Mobile Communications Inc at a news conference at 1000 EST/1500 GMT in Toronto.</p>
<p>Rogers Cantel said earlier today it would hold a &quot;major&quot; media conference at that time.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T Canada spokesman Murray Luening confirmed that AT&amp;T Canada executives would be part of the announcement. Media reports earlier in the month said that AT&amp;T Canada would take a stake in Rogers Cantel under an equity deal.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
